     A                                  3  3'This program can be used for 2 pur-
     A                                      poses:'
     A                                  4  5'1.  On an update tape for a system-
     A                                      , update the menu system for all'
     A                                  5  9'new or changed transactions from t-
     A                                      hat system.  Normally on the'
     A                                  6  9'system release tape, the menu syst-
     A                                      em files for the system will be sen-
     A                                      t'
     A                                  7  9'in a seperate library - for exampl-
     A                                      e, in CSIS/MMIS the lib is MCMENU.'
     A                                  8  9'In this case, source lib = MCMENU,-
     A                                       dest lib = UTPRD, create files = N-
     A                                      ,'
     A                                 11  5'2.  To make a duplicate system in -
     A                                      a multiple database situation.  For'
     A                                 12  9'example, in Valleyfield to create -
     A                                      a duplicate sys CSISMMIS2 for New'
     A                                 13  9'Toronto, source lib = UTPRD, dest -
     A                                      lib = UTPRD, create files? = N,'
     A                                  9  9'Sysnam= CSISMMIS newsys=CSISMMIS u-
     A                                      pdt=Y Add=Y Addauth=N'
     A                                 14  9'Sysnam= CSISMMIS newsys=CSISMMIS2 -
     A                                      updt=Y Add=Y Addauth=N'
     A                                 19 17'New sys'
     A            NEWSYS        10A  B 20 17
